<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Impaginazione Display</title>
<style>
* {box-sizing: border-box;
}
body {margin: 0px;
      padding: 0px;
}    
header { 
       /* testata con blocco nav che scrolla */
         background-color: aquamarine;
         padding: 1px;
         text-align: center;
         color: orange;
         position: fixed;
         width: 100%;
         top: 0px;   
}
nav { 
      text-align: left;
      background-color: beige;
      padding: 1px;
      height: 20px;
      margin-top: 0px;
      
      
     

}
ul { margin-left: 0px;
     padding: 2px;
     margin-top: -3px;


}
/* list style type che cambio il punto elenco e lo rimuovo */
li { list-style-type: none;
     background-color: brown;
     display: inline-block;
     width: 100px;
     height: 20px;
     margin-left: -3px;
     color:white;
     text-transform: uppercase;
     
}
li:hover {
    background-color: burlywood;
    color:white;
}

li a {text-decoration: none;
      color: white;
      padding: 10px;
      width: 100px;

}
li a:hover {
    color:aliceblue;
}

.contenitoregrande {background-color: coral;
                    margin-top: 90px;
                    height:200px;
                    overflow:auto;

}

.box-1 {background-color: lightgreen;
        width: 50%;
        height: 200px;
        display: inline-block;

}
.box-2 {background-color: mediumpurple;
        width:50%;
        margin-left: 50%;
        height: 200px;
        margin-top: -210px;
}
img {z-index: -1;

}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>    
<h1>Display</h1>

<nav>
     <ul>
      <a href="#"><li>Home</li></a>
      <a href="#"><li>Servizi</li></a>
     </ul> 

</nav>
</header>
<!--contenitore grande-->    
<div class="contenitoregrande">
   <!--    box 1     -->
    <div class="box-1">
     <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Cum, architecto sint similique assumenda repudiandae voluptate pariatur distinctio aspernatur odio sed temporibus fuga maxime obcaecati, odit at, eius consequatur commodi molestias.</p>
   </div>
   <!--- fine box 1  -->
   <!--  box 2 -->
   <div class="box-2">
     <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Vel voluptatum eligendi ad, nesciunt ex explicabo blanditiis nam? Sapiente pariatur explicabo voluptas quam, ullam doloremque at totam quas, inventore obcaecati voluptates?</p>
   </div>
   <!--fine vox 2-->
</div>
